[FAIL] H2a   section-five (4): the 62 single-column deletions give exactly 3 distinct F_4 values with multiplicities (12, 20, 30) (the V/F/E group orbits are transitive), each < 12645  --  values -> multiplicities = {'11726': 15, '11832': 25, '11890': 15, '11910': 7} ; family values (per column) = {'V': [11832, 11910], 'F': [11726, 11890], 'E': [11832]}
[FAIL] H2b   section-five (4): the 31 single-line deletions give exactly 3 distinct F_4 values with multiplicities (6, 10, 15), each < 12645  --  values -> multiplicities = {'10807': 5, '11019': 10, '11135': 5, '11175': 1} ; family values (per line) = {'V': [11019, 11175], 'F': [10807, 11135], 'E': [11019]}
